  "prefLabel": "He-M 1002.16 Immediate Suspension of Certification",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-09-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 1002.16 Immediate Suspension of Certification. Notwithstanding the provisions of He-M 1002.15(b), if the department orders immediate suspension of a certificate in accordance with RSA 541-A:30, III, the certificate holder shall immediately transfer all current residents and cease operating.\n\nSource. #7762, eff 9-26-02; ss by #9795, INTERIM, eff 9-26-10, EXPIRES: 3-25-11; ss by #9894-A, eff 3-25-11; ss by #12742, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19\n\nNew. #12916, eff 11-16-19",
